[al:新概念英语第二册]
[ti:14. Do You Speak English]
[00:01.060]Passage 14|文章十四
[00:03.400]Do you speak English?|你会说英语吗？
[00:07.355]I had an amusing experience last year.|去年我有一个有趣的经历。
[00:11.975]After I had left a small village in the south of France,|在我离开法国南部的一个小村庄后，
[00:16.125]I drove on to the next town.|我开车去了下一个城镇。
[00:18.865]On the way,|在路上，
[00:20.445]a young man waved to me.|一个年轻人向我招手。
[00:23.495]I stopped,|我停了下来，
[00:25.215]and he asked me for a lift.|他请求我载他一程。
[00:27.975]As soon as he had got into the car,|他一上车，
[00:30.905]I said good morning to him in French,|我就用法语向他问好，
[00:33.415]and he replied in the same language.|他也用同样的语言回答。
[00:36.595]Apart from a few words,|除了几个单词，
[00:38.800]I do not know any French at all.|我根本不懂法语。
[00:41.720]Neither of us spoke during the journey.|在旅途中我们俩都没有说话。
[00:45.715]I had nearly reached the town,|我快要到达城镇时，
[00:48.375]when the young man suddenly said very slowly,|那个年轻人突然非常缓慢地说：
[00:52.135]Do you speak English?|你会说英语吗？
[00:58.080]As I soon learned,|后来我很快就知道，
[01:00.720]he was English himself.|他自己就是英国人。